# ANCHORED to the repo root. A bare `build/` matches at ANY depth, and it silently swallowed
# app/api/v2/presentation/build/route.ts — the entire Presentation service was never committed, so
# production 404s it while vercel.json and next.config.js still configure the function. `git status`
# stayed clean throughout, because ignored files are never reported as untracked.
